{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>《Realm of Tread》將每日步行轉化為卡牌收集遊戲。每日開始時玩家手持馬鈴薯卡，達成自訂步數目標後，卡牌便會翻開成外星訪客；未能達標則會以馬鈴薯卡收藏。遊戲無需帳戶、無廣告、無追蹤，步數資料只會留在 iPhone 內，適合注重私隱又希望透過步行增添樂趣的人。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>卡牌收集與步行挑戰</h2>\n<p>遊戲內建 Potato Realm 與 Dumpling Realm 兩個領域：前者收錄二百款外星人卡及二百款馬鈴薯卡，後者則有藍色訪客與排列成面孔的餃子。每張卡牌附有獨立插畫、文字與旋律，並可永久收藏。即使相隔一星期回來，已賺取的卡牌仍會等待玩家。應用支援 30 種語言，卡牌文字以英文和日文撰寫。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-473-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-474-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-475-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-476-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-477-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-478-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Realm of Tread</li>\n<li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-24T12:38:52.424393+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":371,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}